<p><b>Side by side, stacked.</b></p>
<ul>
<li>Side by Side (Top/Bottom): a new compare layout that keeps wide shots at full readable width — in the Compare menu, the viewport compare picker, and the web panel (the SBS&#8597; chip). Works everywhere the horizontal split does.</li>
</ul>
