<h2>Asobi 0.2 (build 295)</h2>
<p><b>The whole compare toolkit, on the web.</b></p>
<ul>
<li>Web reviewers get the app's full compare surface: wipe, side by side, difference, mix, add, and full-A/full-B — with a position slider and wipe angle — all driving the room live. The panel appears whenever a compare is running; &#10005; ends it for everyone.</li>
<li>Resync Web Peers moved into the transport bar — a tinted button that appears whenever a web share is live, instead of hiding in the share sheet.</li>
<li>The "Get the app" banner is back at the top of the frame, now as a proper layout row that pushes content down instead of covering controls.</li>
<li>Both brush sliders (SIZE and FILL) stay visible at all times.</li>
</ul>
]]></description>
